ActiveDoc Class
Gargoyle does us a favor here.  When a new file is loaded into a viewer, ggData.behavior.activeDoc _ NIL.  Thus, we can tell if we need to create a new activeDoc.

How do we find out what buttons and variables should be added?  Hard code? User profile?  Track GGStateImpl?.  KAP. September 30, 1992.
